    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You\u2019ve seen the patterns. You\u2019ve memorized the rooms. But something is wrong.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the end of your assignment\u2014and maybe more. In <i>Final Shift</i>, the last entry in the <i>Observer Protocol: The Station</i> arc, the station itself begins to feel aware of your presence. The feeds flicker more often. The changes come faster. And your instincts start to betray you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not escalation. This is collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Final Shift</strong> continues the minimalist surveillance horror formula with a final set of unnerving spaces to monitor. But the anomalies are no longer content to hide. Some will wait for you. Some will tempt you. Some just want to be seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep watching. Or don\u2019t.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The final set of haunting rooms aboard The Station\u2014some disturbingly familiar</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More anomalies than before.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surprises that challenge your memory, attention, and sanity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat. No tutorials. No escape. Just you, the feeds, and the truth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A standalone experience, but the closing chapter in <i>The Station</i> arc of <i>Observer Protocol</i></p></li></ul>",
